1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,742
Speaking, task two. Card number 18. You are in a furniture shop. You want to buy a bed. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,433 --> 00:00:14,172
You are in a furniture shop. You want to buy a bed.

3
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:17,861
Good afternoon. What can I do for you?

4
00:00:23,067 --> 00:00:25,491
Good afternoon, how big is this bed?

5
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,967
The bed is 160 by 200 centimetres.

6
00:00:34,167 --> 00:00:35,200
How much is it?

7
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,067
It costs 12,000 crowns.

8
00:00:42,267 --> 00:00:43,650
Will you deliver it to my home?

9
00:00:43,867 --> 00:00:45,800
Yes, we'll arrange delivery to your home.

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Is the mattress included in the price?

11
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,867
No, you have to buy the mattress separately.

12
00:00:55,067 --> 00:00:58,067
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:00:58,267 --> 00:00:59,419
Goodbye.

14
00:00:59,633 --> 00:01:07,753
Practise card 18 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
